Title: Corby dog saved after being stuck down well for 11 days
Date: 2025-07-13
Firsthand information: {'Speaker': [{'Speaker': 'Dorota Gruszczynska', 'Text': 'We searched the area so many times and nothing, we created posters, put them online and sent them around the local area,', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 6, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 104}}, {'Speaker': 'Dorota Gruszczynska', 'Text': 'We thought he had been hit by a car and we would never see him again.', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 8, 'StartChar': 86, 'EndChar': 145}}, {'Speaker': 'Dorota Gruszczynska', 'Text': 'Firefighters had been called to the area, and had heard him barking, they asked if he had a green harness on and told me he was alive.', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 10, 'StartChar': 12, 'EndChar': 131}}, {'Speaker': 'Dorota Gruszczynska', 'Text': "It was near where we had lost him, we had called him so much in the area, but never heard him barking. We couldn't believe it was him.", 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 11, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 146}}, {'Speaker': 'Dorota Gruszczynska', 'Text': "We're so grateful for everyone who helped, including the drone company. They did a huge amount of work, purely out of their heart.", 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 12, 'StartChar': 14, 'EndChar': 131}}, {'Speaker': 'Dorota Gruszczynska', 'Text': 'So many people shared the cause, and it helped as the firefighters knew to contact me.', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 13, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 80}}, {'Speaker': 'Dorota Gruszczynska', 'Text': "He's back on his feet, he's recovered surprisingly well, we don't know how he survived, there must have been water in the well,", 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 18, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 120}}], 'Description': [{'Description': 'Then on 2 July, she got a message from a firefighter saying they thought they had her dog.', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 9, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 74}}, {'Description': 'Northamptonshire Fire and Rescue Service confirmed a Corby crew was attending a nearby fire when they heard the sound of a dog barking that was found down a well on Stephenson Way.', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 14, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 164}}, {'Description': 'It said crews used a reach pole and lines to lift cylinders off Jimmy, so he could be lifted to safety.', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 15, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 89}}, {'Description': 'After searching local missing dog pages, it was able to contact his owner, it added.', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 16, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 75}}, {'Description': 'Ms Gruszczynska said Jimmy was taken to the vets to be checked over, and was found to be really hungry but not dehydrated.', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 17, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 133}}], 'Image': [{'ID': 'image_1', 'Caption': 'A dog in the bottom of a well, wearing a green harness, by metal cylinders, he is looking up at the camera, the dog is black, white and brown in colour. '}]}
